 of all what i'd like to say is uh  the the media coverage the participation  from the media throughout this has has  been quite incredible um the the  documentation of the activities that are  going on has given people the real life  experience of what's occurring out there  so for that i thank you i also know the  media has been subjected to  slurs  to abuse to illegal activities to  themselves so we have one active  investigation ongoing right now and i  would ask that if there are any more  activities that need to be reported  please report to the ottawa police  service because we will take them  seriously and conduct an investigation  around those activities  i have to thank the officers that came  here  it's nothing short of incredible the  people that showed up for us  the municipalities the federal  provincial police services that actually  attended ottawa to help us take our  streets back was amazing but beyond them  i actually have to thank the communities  that they came from there are many many  people across the country that actually  let their police officers go to help the  citizens of ottawa and for that i thank  them  finally it's important for me to  recognize the community i talked about  community healing i talked about the  steps that we have to go on to move  ahead and they are many and they will be  hard and they will be long but you have  the commitment of this service to  actually engage in those there are many  steps that we have to take but they are  going to be important discussions and  dialogue so that we can heal as a  community and come together thank you  very much  um

